    "homepage_faqs_c4rwk9": {
      "type": "homepage-faqs",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_DEDNEX": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where should I visit?",
            "copy": "<p>Our main showroom is at 457 Industrial Way, Benicia, CA 94510. This is our primary location with 63,500 sq ft of facilities including our French Fitness showroom and remanufactured equipment on display. Stop by Monday through Friday, 8 AM to 3:30 PM to see equipment in person and speak with our specialists. Can't visit? Schedule a video call for a virtual tour, or browse our full inventory online.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_8fcyhb": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you remanufacture on site?",
            "copy": "<p>Yes. 80% of our remanufactured equipment is rebuilt right here at our Benicia facility. Each machine is fully disassembled, sandblasted or sanded, repainted, and reassembled to factory specifications. We replace all belts, bearings, and batteries, plus any component showing more than 25% wear. Our 50+ person team handles the entire process in-house, and every unit is inspected and tested before shipping.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_TYBBfD": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you ship nationwide?",
            "copy": "<p>Yes, we ship to all 50 states. Orders within 120 to 200 miles of Benicia are delivered by our own trucks. Beyond that, we partner with freight carriers for larger equipment and use USPS, FedEx, or UPS for smaller items. We also offer international shipping and in-store pickup at no additional charge.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_bn9m7E": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How fast can I receive my order?",
            "copy": "<p>It depends on the product type. Brand new equipment typically ships within 2 to 7 business days, with transit adding 2 to 14 business days to the lower 48 states. Remanufactured equipment takes 2 to 5 weeks since it's built to order. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
